WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
A shape is only the beginning.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:11.000
Find the parts. Keep their identities.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Understand the connection: a lid that stays on its hinge.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Keep geometry, motion and evidence in one object program.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Let an agent find the interaction it needs.

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Interaction Twin. Show it once. Keep how it works.

